[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "破損した核の構造を解析し、それを元に\n修復するための道具のレシピをまとめました",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I've analyzed the damaged core's structure and compiled a recipe for the tools we'll need to repair it."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……どうでしょうか？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...What do you think?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "よくここまで解析できましたね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Your analysis is quite impressive."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "プラフタ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Plachta"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "様々な理論を統合しつつも、破綻なくまとまっている。\nこれなら結果も期待できるだろう",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "You've managed to integrate various theories without any contradictions. We can expect good results from this."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "キースグリフ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Keithgriff"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "本当ですか！？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Really!?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "一人でレシピを完成させちゃうなんて、\nすごいよ、レスナちゃん！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Completing a recipe all by yourself... You're amazing, Resna!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ロロナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Rorona"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "うん！\u3000ついに、やり遂げたんだね！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yeah! You've finally done it!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ソフィー",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Sophie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……私、無我夢中でした。\nとにかく、ヴァレリアを助けたいって……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...I was completely absorbed in it. I just wanted to save Valeria, no matter what..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "頑張ったね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "You did great."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ライザ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ryza"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "はいっ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Thank you!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "レシピはこれでいいとして、\n問題は核の修復に必要な素材ですね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "The recipe looks sound, but the materials needed to repair the core remain an issue."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "プラフタ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Plachta"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そういえば、何か正体が分からない素材があるって……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Oh right, there was some material you couldn't identify..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ソフィー",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Sophie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あ、はい。一応、似たもので代用できないか\n検証中でして……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yes. I'm currently testing if we can substitute it with something similar..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "この間、ララさんたちが向かった森に\nもう一度素材を集めに行こうかと思っています",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I was thinking of going back to the forest where Lara and the others went to gather more materials."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "まだ足りない素材もありますから",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "We're still short on some ingredients."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "分かった。じゃあ、あたしたちは\nできる範囲で調合の準備を進めておくね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Got it. We'll get started on the synthesis preparations where we can."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ソフィー",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Sophie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "はい、よろしくお願いします！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yes, thank you so much!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そっちは一人で大丈夫？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "You sure you'll be okay on your own?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ライザ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ryza"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ああ、はい。実は、ある人に助っ人をお願いしようと\n思っていまして",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Oh, yes. Actually, I was planning to ask someone for help."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ある人……？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Someone...?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ロロナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Rorona"
        }
      }
    }
  }
]